        },
        "refresh": 2,
        "regex": "",
        "skipUrlSync": false,
        "sort": 1,
        "type": "query",
        "description": "Sourced from outbox_pending_entries_ratio, not from a bus counter: every relay samples it on an interval regardless of traffic, while bus_events_published_total has no series at all until a real write publishes one — so a picker built on that is empty on a lab nobody has written to yet. includeAll with allValue '.*' is what keeps an empty list harmless: without it the variable interpolates to service_name=~\"\", which matches nothing and blanks every panel on the dashboard."
